<title>USA: Bull &amp; Bear Global increases monthly div.</title>
<headline>Bull &amp; Bear Global increases monthly div.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bull &amp; Bear Global Income Fund Inc said it declared a monthly dividend to $0.07 per share, up from $0.05 per share.</p>
<p>The fund said it increased the dividend as part of its newly adopted 10 percent distribution policy.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable June 30 to shareholders of record on June 16.</p>
</text>
